<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Harcourt, Genetics.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Harcourt, Genetics.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it removed Harcourt General Inc and Genetics Institute Inc from the firm's focus list.</p>
<p>-- Harcourt shares were unchanged at 48 in early New York Stock Exchange trade and Genetics shares slipped 1/8 to 84-3/4 on Nasdaq.</p>
</text>
